{
  "_comment": "Recorded POST /ag-ui streams of the Boardroom backend (ASISaga/boardroom, boardroom_function/agui_surface.py + agui_mapping.py; spec 07 Evt-to-AG-UI table). \"{{threadId}}\" and \"{{runId}}\" are replaced with the ids of the request the client sent.",
  "turn_complete": [
